{"data":{"target":{"id":"ENSG00000055609","approvedSymbol":"KMT2C","functionDescriptions":["Histone methyltransferase that catalyzes methyl group transfer from S-adenosyl-L-methionine to the epsilon-amino group of 'Lys-4' of histone H3 (H3K4) (PubMed:25561738). Part of chromatin remodeling machinery predominantly forms H3K4me1 methylation marks at active chromatin sites where transcription and DNA repair take place (PubMed:22266653, PubMed:24081332, PubMed:25561738). Likely plays a redundant role with KMT2D in enriching H3K4me1 mark on primed and active enhancer elements (PubMed:24081332). {ECO:0000269|PubMed:22266653, ECO:0000269|PubMed:24081332, ECO:0000269|PubMed:25561738}."],"proteinIds":[{"id":"Q8NEZ4","source":"uniprot_swissprot"},{"id":"A0A7P0T8F0","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A7P0T9K8","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A7P0T9N3","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A7P0T9Q7","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A7P0T9U9","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A7P0TA60","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A7P0TAI3","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A7P0TAQ8","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A7P0TBM6","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A7P0Z448","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HHW0","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HI08","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HIF3","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HIG3","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HIK3","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HIM1","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HIM6","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HIS4","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HIW6","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HJ27","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HJ77","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HJR9","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HJT1","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HJU5","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HJV8","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HK48","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HKJ1","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8